I"ß<h2 id="materials-synthesis--assembly">Materials Synthesis &amp; Assembly</h2>

<p>A representative workflow combines liquid and powder dispensing with mechanical assembly. Relevant robotic skills include grasping, alignment, insertion, placement, sealing, turning and fastening. The SAFE-BOLT assembly demonstrator provides a focused setting for developing these contact-rich capabilities.</p>

<h2 id="microscope-centered-optofluidic-workflow">Microscope-Centered Optofluidic Workflow</h2>

<p>A second representative workflow includes microliter pipetting, handling glass and films, and interacting with instrument controls. These operations emphasize precision, careful force regulation and perception under reflections and transparent materials.</p>

<h2 id="shared-manipulation-primitives">Shared Manipulation Primitives</h2>

<p>The project studies reusable primitives across workflows and robotic platforms, including align/insert, press/seal, pipette actuation and turn/fasten.</p>
